      "problem": "$\\frac{7}{2}u+4w-\\frac{2}{3}u-w=${{field-1}}\n$u\\,+$\n{{field-2}}\n$w$",
      "worked_solution": "We collect and combine the like terms, simplifying the coefficients as much as possible:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}u+4w-\\frac{2}{3}u-w & = \\\\ (\\frac{7}{2}u-\\frac{2}{3}u)+(4w-w) & = \\\\ (\\frac{7}{2}-\\frac{2}{3})u+(4-1)w & = \\\\ (\\frac{21}{6}-\\frac{4}{6})u+3w & = \\\\ (\\frac{21-4}{6})u+3w & = \\\\ \\frac{17}{6}\\,u+3\\,w\\end{aligned}\n$$",
